        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the issue!\n\nI can reproduce, but not yet sure if this behavior is expected or not. On one hand, empty region inside parenthesis is before the cursor and `MiniAi.find_textobject('i', ')', { search_method = 'cover_or_next' })` also returns no region. But on the other hand, the same can be said for case if there is something inside parenthesis and `find_textobject` returns a single character region.\n\nI'll take a look.",
