        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "This should now be fixed on latest `main`.\n\nTurns out, it was a [known behavior](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/1599a473aa6f5290a5d740b1144846e6f0c3963d/tests/test_ai.lua#L1880-L1883) with a at least some logic behind it.\n\nHowever, after another fresh look I think I found a reasonable way to address this in a consistent way (explained in 505cd583c22b7448ccd98949ab8f81c80bac73e9).",
